  "summary": [
    "Model boundary: logical definition only, JSON file storage, current files versus last confirmed index are distinct, no notification state",
    "Table of logical information with identifiers, attributes, primary sources and relations",
    "Document info is stored once per doc_link_id and shared by all ToC identification keys",
    "Confirmed ToC holds only per-key data: version, target spec, member document IDs, back references",
    "AI-generated fields may be ungenerated when the search backend is doc-db; staleness judged by content hash",
    "Cardinality: one key has many document IDs, one document ID belongs to many keys, at most one confirmed ToC per key",
    "Section identification by trailing DLID on headings; sections without DLID have no stable identity",
    "Meaning and freshness of values: document ID versus content hash, reference check results valid only for recorded scope and time",
    "Documents leaving the index target are removed from the confirmed ToC without searching outside scope",
    "No unresolved relations at present"
  ],
